cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the thesis below."
title: "iCorrVision 2D"
type: software
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-30"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/iCorrVision/iCorrVision-2D"
authors:
  - family-names: "Récio"
    given-names: "João Pedro da Silva Duarte"
abstract: >-
  Version 2 of iCorrVision 2D: a subset-based two-dimensional digital image
  correlation (DIC) engine, usable as a Python package, from the command line or
  through a PySide6 graphical interface. It is a reimplementation that shares no
  code with iCorrVision-2D version 1 (SoftwareX, 2022).
keywords:
  - digital image correlation
  - experimental mechanics
  - strain measurement
  - Python
